# Generated dotted import copies emitted next to a root-level build target
# (e.g. tv.runtime.session.tkv). These are STALE duplicates of the canonical
# sources under tv/ and stdlib/ - several had already drifted. Never edit or
# commit them; sync the canonical file instead.
/tv.*.tkv

# Distribution output: a full duplicate of the source tree plus a bundled
# compiler .exe (which *.exe already excludes, so committing it would produce
# an incomplete package). Kept as a local directory, not in git.
/release/
